%% Conversation state as stored (there is no explicit state machine in code).
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Active: conversations.create()
    Active --> Active: message / rename / pin / model override
    Active --> Archived: conv:arch
    Archived --> Active: conv:unarch
    Active --> [*]: conv:delok (hard delete, cascades messages)
    Archived --> [*]: conv:delok
    note right of Archived
        Archived conversations are listed separately
        and have no pagination (known gap).
    end note
